01:19:46.118 --> 01:19:48.285
What's one thing you do know?


01:19:50.889 --> 01:19:52.322
You like money?


01:19:52.325 --> 01:19:55.692
And do you think I spend it,
or save it?


01:19:58.430 --> 01:19:59.897
Save it?


01:19:59.898 --> 01:20:03.301
And if I've been
saving for eleven years,


01:20:03.304 --> 01:20:05.269
how much do you think I have?


01:20:05.272 --> 01:20:06.938
A lot?


01:20:06.939 --> 01:20:09.341
Try a fuck of a lot.


01:20:10.778 --> 01:20:13.578
So when can I see
those drawings?


01:20:15.015 --> 01:20:17.349
Next week. Definitely.


01:20:17.350 --> 01:20:19.518
I expect a friends
and family discount.


01:20:19.519 --> 01:20:22.055
Yeah, without a doubt.


01:20:23.358 --> 01:20:25.658
Let me give you
my lawyer's details.


01:20:25.659 --> 01:20:28.660
Have your wife call as soon
as the police arrest you.


01:20:28.663 --> 01:20:30.896
Tell her Patricia referred you.


01:20:30.899 --> 01:20:34.033
That's your real name?
Patricia?


01:20:34.034 --> 01:20:35.834
Patricia Cornbluth.


01:20:35.837 --> 01:20:39.771
Now beat it.
I need my beauty sleep.


01:20:39.774 --> 01:20:43.177
Thank you.
Patricia...


01:20:44.213 --> 01:20:45.811
<i>Cornbluth.</i>


01:20:49.250 --> 01:20:50.784
Oh, and, Guy?


01:20:50.785 --> 01:20:53.553
When you come back
with those drawings...


01:20:53.556 --> 01:20:56.389
these will be waiting for you.


01:20:56.392 --> 01:20:59.860
I can't wait.


01:21:42.940 --> 01:21:45.006
You came back.


01:21:45.009 --> 01:21:47.743
Anne...


01:21:47.746 --> 01:21:51.614
I am so sorry that I
got us into this mess,


01:21:51.617 --> 01:21:53.816
but Nikki...


01:21:53.819 --> 01:21:58.522
she has this lawyer who will
handle the entire thing,


01:21:58.525 --> 01:22:02.159
and she might not charge us,
as a favor to Nikki.


01:22:02.162 --> 01:22:05.530
I think if I go peacefully,


01:22:05.531 --> 01:22:09.333
maybe they won't
come down too hard on me.


01:22:09.334 --> 01:22:11.570
What are you talking about?


01:22:11.571 --> 01:22:15.338
Weren't... they here?
The police?


01:22:16.442 --> 01:22:18.076
No.


01:22:20.181 --> 01:22:21.846
Did they call?


01:22:21.847 --> 01:22:23.815
No, Guy, no police
have come or called.


01:22:23.816 --> 01:22:26.218
What the hell is going on?


01:22:31.791 --> 01:22:35.593
Maybe I dreamt the whole thing.


01:22:35.596 --> 01:22:38.031
<i>Are you in some kind of trouble?</i>


01:22:41.168 --> 01:22:42.767
Maybe not.


01:22:46.640 --> 01:22:49.909
I'm glad you're back.


01:22:49.912 --> 01:22:53.746
I didn't think you were coming
back after my mini meltdown.


01:22:56.618 --> 01:22:59.753
You're allowed
to have a meltdown.


01:22:59.756 --> 01:23:03.056
Of course I was coming back.


01:23:03.059 --> 01:23:05.859
How else was I gonna be
able to give you this?


01:23:08.264 --> 01:23:10.430
What did you have to do
to get all this?


01:23:10.433 --> 01:23:12.166
You don't wanna know.


01:23:12.167 --> 01:23:13.466
Actually, I do.


01:23:15.506 --> 01:23:19.673
Okay.
I'll tell you everything.


01:23:19.676 --> 01:23:22.977
Because...
Because the police


01:23:22.980 --> 01:23:27.214
are probably going
to come here and take me away.


01:23:27.217 --> 01:23:29.885
So, umm...
What?


01:23:29.886 --> 01:23:32.953
But I want you to know that...


01:23:36.828 --> 01:23:40.561
I don't care anymore
about ducks being in a row.


01:23:42.066 --> 01:23:43.799
I don't.


01:23:43.802 --> 01:23:46.201
Ducks be damned.


01:23:46.204 --> 01:23:49.871
As long as I have you
and our daughter...


01:23:51.008 --> 01:23:53.308
Ducks can go fuck themselves.


01:23:53.311 --> 01:23:56.679
I don't think that
would be a good idea.


01:23:56.682 --> 01:23:59.816
Then there'd just be
more to take care of.


01:24:01.286 --> 01:24:04.754
Is that...
is that a siren?


01:24:04.756 --> 01:24:07.992
No. That is
the John Lennon mobile


01:24:07.993 --> 01:24:09.492
I attached to the crib.


01:24:10.830 --> 01:24:13.564
I assembled it myself...


01:24:13.567 --> 01:24:16.333
and a few other things.


01:25:01.249 --> 01:25:04.552
Isn't this that Volvo
we were lookin' for.


01:25:09.257 --> 01:25:11.992
It is that Volvo
we were lookin' for.


01:25:11.995 --> 01:25:16.128
Motherfucker's behind
on like, six payments.


01:25:18.468 --> 01:25:20.567
Let's go repo that shit.


01:25:20.570 --> 01:25:22.503
Yeah.
Yeah.

